  "caveat": "All 97 modifiers from the rendered Modifiers page. Stat keys: dmg = damage, spd = use speed, crit = critical chance, size = size, kb = knockback, vel = velocity, mana = mana cost, arm_pen = armor penetration, tag_dmg = summon tag damage, def = defense, move_speed, melee_speed, max_mana. Stats the page marks 'n/s' (not stated) are omitted. tier = rarity change; value = value change; tier null = not stated. Read via summarising fetch; spot-check numbers.",
  "reforge_notes": [
    "Reforge cost is one-third of the item's buy value (166.67% of sell price); Discount Card or Greedy Ring reduces it by 20%.",
    "Modifiers shift rarity by up to two tiers and value by up to +210% / -69%.",
    "Initial modifiers have up to a 75% chance of applying.",
    "Weapon value scales with the square of each stat multiplier; crit counts double.",
    "Accessory value: mana multiplier x0.75; other stats x5."
  ],
  "restrictions": [
    "Copper Axe and Wooden Hammer cannot receive damage-affecting melee modifiers; spears, flails and yoyos cannot receive melee-only modifiers.",
    "Harpoon cannot receive Unreal; weapons with no knockback cannot receive knockback modifiers.",
    "Weapons consuming 3 mana or less cannot receive mana-decreasing modifiers.",
    "Summon tag damage only applies to targets with a whip tag effect (Blade Staff tag multiplier 0.67)."
